    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present this beautiful bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment to the market with a sunny south west facing balcony. No. 35 is located on the 4th floor of the highly sought-after development of Alexander Court, Dublin 24. The development is always in high demand as it is within easy reach of all local amenities including shopping facilities such as the Square Shopping Centre, a variety of bars & restaurants, an extensive choice of sports grounds & leisure facilities, and a great mix of primary & secondary schools. The area is well serviced with excellent bus routes and road networks and The Red Luas Line is within mere minutes' walk. \r\n \r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 53 sqm briefly comprises of entrance hall with two separate storage rooms, large open plan living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, double bedroos with built in wardrobe and main family bathroom. A door from the living area leads out onto a private balcony of the lowest maintenance and a highly sought after south west facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings. \r\n\r\nNo. 35 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners. Further benefits here include fitted wardrobes in bedroom, spacious balcony and double-glazed windows with top quality blinds to name but a few. \r\nDue to condition and location, we see this property being extremely popular amongst a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get onto the property ladder, investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area or anyone looking to downsize and have all amenities on your doorstep so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\nBER B\r\nC. 53 sqm\r\nDesignated underground parking space\r\nManagement fee c. 1,218.60 per annum\r\n1 Bed / 1 Bath\r\nLocated on the 4th floor\r\nExtra spacious apartment\r\nEntrance hallway with two storage rooms\r\nLarge open plan living/dining area\r\nFully fitted kitchen\r\nGenerous bedroom\r\nBuilt in wardrobes\r\nMain family bathroom \r\nSunny balcony\r\nSouth west facing orientation \r\nPrivate balcony \r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nTop quality blinds \r\nTop spec electric heating\r\nAmple storage space\r\nBright and spacious\r\nWithin arm's reach of N7 and M50 Motorway\r\nHighly sought-after development\r\nPrime for first time buyers, investors and downsizers alike!\r\n\r\nDirections D24 Y27A"
      },
      {
